    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkoowa ngole ūngī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī yenīyī, ū moyo gwakwe ū ntemi Ahasuelo gwika, ūng'wizūkwa ū Vashiti, nī yīyo walī wīyīta, nī yīyo yalī yamala kūtūūlwa mu shilagīlo kūlwa nguno yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami ba ntemi būng'wīla, “Baba ntemi, Īkūbelela ū ntemi akoobelwe banhya basoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ni watūūla banhū ū mu sī pyī ījo ajisugile, babasoleleje pye a banhya a basoga babenhe mu nzengo gwa Susa a h'ikūlū aha. Ū Hegai ū nsoloolwa wa ntemi, ū nang'hani wa bakīma, akūbalang'hana; binhwe na shikolo sha kūbagunanha kwigaliila, babize basoga jigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū munhya ūyo alantoge ū ntemi, abize ngole a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Vashiti.” Ū mhayo gwenūyū gūnyeja ū ntemi, wīta chene ng'hana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esita na fumo yakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nzengo gwa Susa walīho ngosha Nyudaya, lina lyakwe Modekai, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yaili, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shimei, ng'wana Kishi; wa mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei walī ūmò wa banhū abo baalī basaamiwa na ntemi Nebukadineza wa Babuloni, kūfuma Yelusalemu; walī ūmò wa banhū abo bakasaamiwa hamò na ntemi Yekonia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yekonia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Yehoyachini.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī n'ilūmbūye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "N'ilūmbūye:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A basaabo baalī ba shikūlū na shizuna.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " witanagwa Hadasa, ūyo olī anelile; a ba ise nū nina baalī bazumalīka, h'ī chene ū Modekai akansola ūnela, ūbiza gītī nshīke okwe. Ū ng'wanikī ng'wenūyo lina līngī witanagwa Esta; nīyo olī n'ihanga isoga no ū kūlola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū aho shafunyiwa ī shilagīlo sha ntemi, banhya bingī būbilingwa; benhwa ū mu nzengo gwa Susa, biza būtūūlwa mu makono ga ng'wa Hegai. Nū Esita ūtwalwa ū kwikūlū lya ntemi, nang'hwe ūbiza ūmò wabo abo balang'hanagwa na Hegai, ūyo walī nang'hani wa bakīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hegai ūnyegela ū ng'wanikī ng'wenūyo, ūmona gīkī igeleelilwe; hūna ūng'winha ī shikolo ī sha kwigaliila ongeje ū kūbeela, nī sha kūlya ī sha kūbeeja mīlī. Ūng'winha na banikī mpungatī, būsolanyiwa kūfuma mu banikī ba ng'wikūlū; babize ba kūyūntūmamīla, hūna ūntūūla hamò na a bagunanhi bakwe, h'ipandī lyawiza ū ng'wikūlū ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esita walī ataalī ū kūlīhaya ī lihanga lyakwe, nūūlū ī fumo ya banhū ba shibyalīlwe shakwe, nguno ū Modekai walī wanemeja ū kwimanīcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lūshikū ū Modekai wayela yelaga a ha būtongi w'ibīndo lya numba ya bakīma yenīyo, amane ūmo walī ū Esita, nū mumo yajīlaga ī mihayo yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasuelo kūnsola Esita",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wanikī ose ose aho ataalī kūja ū kwibona nū ntemi Ahasuelo, yalī īng'wigeleelilwe kūmala myeji ikūmi n'ībīlī akwigaliilaga abeele jigi, h'ūmo baalī bahelelilwe a bakīma; myeji ītandatū bakwībilaga maguta ga būlenji, na myeji ītandatū bakūtūmamīlaga būgota bo kūbeeja ikoba lya mīlī, na malashi ga mbika na mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū lyūshika ī likanza lya kūja ū kūlī ntemi, ū ng'wanikī walī azunīlījiwe kūlomba shose shose īsho ūtogwa kūjana ū kwikūlū lya ntemi, ūsola kūfuma ū mu numba ya bakīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa kūja mhīndī, wīnga koi dilū, washikīla kū numba yīngī, nayo ya kūlang'hanīlwa bakīma; ī yene yalī ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Shashigazi, nang'hwe nsoloolwa wa ntemi, ūyo wabalang'hanaga a bake ba ntemi. Ū ng'wanikī ng'wene walī atazunīlījiwe kūja hangī ū kūlī ntemi, numho ū ntemi antogwe, ang'witane na lina lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū Esita ū nshīke o ng'wa Abihaili lūshika nang'hwe ū lūdīīma lwakwe lwa kūja ū kūlī ntemi. Ū ise ū Abihaili, walī ise ndo o ng'wa Modekai; ū Modekai h'ūyo walī wansola ū Esita ūnela, ūng'wisaaba kūbiza nshīke wakwe. Ū ng'wanikī ng'wenūyo atalombile shose shose, ūja dūhū nī shisho shikahayiwa na Hegai, ū nsoloolwa wa ntemi, ūyo walī nang'hani wa bakīma. Gwike pye a banhū abo bamonaga ū Esita wabayejaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alītwalwa ū mu numba y'ikūlū ūmo wikalaga ū ntemi Ahasuelo, gwalī ng'weji gw'ikūmi, mu ng'weji gwa Tebesi, ng'waka gwa mpungatī gwa būsugi bokwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūntogwa no ū Esita, kūtinda pye a bakīma a bangī, ūdutwa no ūnyegela kūbaheeba pye a banhya a bangī. Ūntūūlīla ī ngikili ya nyagole, ūng'wīta kūbiza ngole, a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Vashiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūbeeja shigukulu kūlwa ng'wa Esita, būlaalīkwa pye a bana ng'oma, na a batūmami bakwe. Ūlagīja pye a banhū ba mu sī ījo walī ajisugile bifuule ī milīmo ū lūshikū lwenūlo, ūbagabanhya na manong'ho kūlwa wiza ng'holò wakwe wa nyatemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basīīgani ba kūmūlaga ntemi kūmanwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhya bibilinga hangī lūkangala lwa kabīlī, ī likanza lyenīlo ū Modekai ūkigasha ha mita gwa ha ng'wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esita wasangwa ataalī ū kūbawīla ī fumo ya shibyalīlwe shakwe, nūūlū ī lihanga lyakwe, ūmo Modekai walī wanangīīlīla, nguno ū Esita walī ataalī ang'wigwile ū Modekai, gīt'ūmo wītīlaga dūhū aho ataalī anelile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza īlo walī igashije ha mita gwa ha ng'wa ntemi ū Modekai, batūmami babīlī ba ntemi, balang'hani ba ha mita: Bigisana na Teleshi, bandya kūnsīīga ū ntemi Ahasuelo. Bakoobaga nzīla ya kūmūlaga, nguno baalī bampelanīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
